        <mxCell id="ZGJELK_URDpaztj-pYhR-2" value="&lt;b&gt;CMD case creator api&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;- create a new case in CMD&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- get uuid back&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- entities will be [], will be filled in as part of the round trip in recognize&lt;br&gt;- body description is the description_without_questions&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- send response to client&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- publish new-case-created&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1">
