        <mxCell id="ZGJELK_URDpaztj-pYhR-6" value="&lt;b&gt;New module&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- listens to new-case-created&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- post to dx, get the dx id&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- in dx, for &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(220, 220, 170); background-color: rgb(30, 30, 30); font-family: &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Menlo, Monaco, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;createTopicPublic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;don&#39;t trigger case created or updated message for CMD&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- update the CMD case id lookup table before publishing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- publish case-created-env to trigger recognize entities&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;" vertex="1" parent="1">
